      "_tone": "Brief, friendly release notes. Use line breaks (\\n) between bullet points.",
      "en": "Hex Chess now natively supports macOS!",
      "ar": "الشطرنج السداسي يدعم الآن macOS بشكل أصلي!",
      "da": "Hexskak understøtter nu macOS nativt!",
